Specialized KG manager — investigates and mutates the live emi.db knowledge graph.

Runs a planner loop with these capabilities:
- Read: kg_query (full SQL SELECT), pod_search, pod_fetch.
- Mutate (typed, audit-logged): kg_merge_nodes, kg_create_edge, kg_create_state_node, kg_close_state, kg_rename_label, kg_update_node_field, kg_delete_edge.
- Finding lifecycle: kg_finding_resolve, kg_finding_escalate.

Every commit writes a reversible kg_revision_log row. The planner dry-runs destructive ops first when uncertain.

Use this whenever a task involves the KG. emi_team and master_room should delegate here rather than reasoning about the KG themselves. Pass a fully disambiguated instruction; for mutations include concrete node ids and a reason for the audit log.
